Gandharva Grāmaṇī gives Dēvavatī to Sukēśa --- Dēvavatī bears Mālyavān Sumālin Mālin --- Brothers perform world-heating penance on Mēru --- Brahmā grants invincibility long life unity --- Brothers torment gods beyond protection --- Viśvakarman assigns Śakra-ordered golden Laṅkā --- Brothers settle moated Laṅkā joyfully --- Narmadā gives three moon-faced daughters in order --- Mālyavān fathers Vajramuṣṭi brood, Sumālin Prahasta Kaikasī brood, Mālin Vibhīṣaṇa ministers --- Sons with fathers torment gods and rites